      "endIndex": 2776,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Yes, linen forms soft wrinkles as you move. Don't fight it! That natural, slightly creased texture is the exact hallmark of pure, high-quality linen. It shows that you are wearing a premium natural fiber and gives your outfit a relaxed, confident charm.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
