      "text": "Got a dinner date on a warm night? Swap the shorts for our lightweight [Men's Chinos](https://cottonworld.net/search?type=product&q=mens+chinos) or linen trousers in navy or olive. Tuck in a well-ironed linen shirt, add a woven belt, and you instantly look like the best-dressed guy in the room.",
