      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00050",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[50]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4429,
      "endIndex": 4550,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Linen is incredibly durableâ€”it actually gets softer and stronger the more you wash it. Just follow these simple rules.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00051",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[51]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4550,
      "endIndex": 4551,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00052",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[52]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4551,
      "endIndex": 4673,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "1. Wash Cold: Always wash your linen in cold water. Hot water can damage the natural fibers and cause unwanted shrinkage.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00053",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[53]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4673,
      "endIndex": 4841,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "2. Skip the Tumble Dryer: Never put pure linen in a hot dryer unless you want it to shrink dramatically! Hang it up in the shade and let the warm air dry it naturally.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00054",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[54]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 4841,
      "endIndex": 5067,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "3. Embrace the Steam: Don't obsess over ironing your linen until it is perfectly flat; you will ruin its natural charm. Just use a garment steamer to drop the heaviest creases, and let the soft, natural texture shine through.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
