      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00071",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[71]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5355,
      "endIndex": 5356,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00072",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[72]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5356,
      "endIndex": 5397,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "1. Does 100% linen shrink after washing?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00073",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[73]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5397,
      "endIndex": 5659,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Because it is a completely natural fiber, pure linen can experience very minor tightening after its first wash. However, if you strictly follow the care instructionsâ€”washing in cold water and air-dryingâ€”it will easily maintain its original, comfortable fit.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00074",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[74]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5659,
      "endIndex": 5660,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00075",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[75]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5660,
      "endIndex": 5698,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "2. Are wrinkles in linen a bad thing?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00076",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[76]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5698,
      "endIndex": 5911,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Not at all! The soft creases that form when you wear linen are considered a sign of luxury and authenticity. It shows that you are wearing a breathable, premium natural fabric rather than a stiff synthetic blend.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00077",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[77]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5911,
      "endIndex": 5912,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00078",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[78]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5912,
      "endIndex": 5960,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "3. Is linen better than cotton for hot weather?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00079",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[79]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5960,
      "endIndex": 6220,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Both are excellent natural fabrics, but linen has a slight edge in extreme heat. Because its fibers are hollow and woven more loosely, it promotes slightly more airflow and dries faster than standard cotton, making it the ultimate fabric for peak summer days.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00080",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[80]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6220,
      "endIndex": 6221,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00081",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[81]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6221,
      "endIndex": 6264,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "4. Can I wear a linen shirt to the office?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00082",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[82]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6264,
      "endIndex": 6569,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "It depends on how strict your office dress code is. For a highly formal corporate environment, the natural wrinkles of linen might be a bit too relaxed. But for a business-casual or smart-casual office, a well-steamed, solid-colored linen shirt tucked into chinos is a perfectly sharp and stylish choice.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00083",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[83]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6569,
      "endIndex": 6570,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00084",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[84]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6570,
      "endIndex": 6611,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "5. How do I soften my new linen clothes?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00085",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[85]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6611,
      "endIndex": 6783,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The best part about high-quality linen is that it naturally softens over time. The more you wear it and wash it, the softer and more beautifully draped the fabric becomes.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
